{"seq":1,"slug":"schematic-fundamentals","title":"原理图基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/schematic-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"component-symbols-footprints","title":"元器件符号与封装","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/schematic-fundamentals/component-symbols-footprints","wordCount":1485,"readingTime":6},{"seq":2,"slug":"schematic-drawing-standards","title":"原理图绘制规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/schematic-fundamentals/schematic-drawing-standards","wordCount":1378,"readingTime":6},{"seq":3,"slug":"hierarchical-design","title":"层次化设计方法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/pcb-design/schematic-fundamentals/hierarchical-design","wordCount":1424,"readingTime":6}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"原理图基础\">原理图基础</h1><p>原理图是 PCB 设计的起点，它以图形化符号表达电路的逻辑连接关系。高质量的原理图不仅是电路功能的准确描述，更是后续布局布线、信号完整性分析和制造的基础。</p>\n<p>本章涵盖三个核心主题：元器件符号与封装的对应关系及库管理、原理图绘制的工程规范、以及面向复杂系统的层次化设计方法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"章节概览\">章节概览</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>主题</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>元器件符号与封装</td>\n<td>库管理</td>\n<td>符号规范、封装类型、IPC-7351 标准、自建库流程</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>原理图绘制规范</td>\n<td>工程标准</td>\n<td>图纸格式、网络标号、电气规则检查(ERC)、版本管理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>层次化设计方法</td>\n<td>系统架构</td>\n<td>模块分割、层次图表、复用策略、多人协作</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键概念\">关键概念</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[元器件符号] --&gt;|映射| B[封装/焊盘]&#10;    B --&gt;|关联| C[3D 模型]&#10;    A --&gt;|组成| D[原理图]&#10;    D --&gt;|生成| E[网表 Netlist]&#10;    E --&gt;|导入| F[PCB 布局]\">graph LR\n    A[元器件符号] --&gt;|映射| B[封装/焊盘]\n    B --&gt;|关联| C[3D 模型]\n    A --&gt;|组成| D[原理图]\n    D --&gt;|生成| E[网表 Netlist]\n    E --&gt;|导入| F[PCB 布局]</pre>"}